# Raw secret value, one line, no KEY= prefix — password for the dedicated
# uid=unix-login,ou=people,... LLDAP bind account
# (modules/unix-ldap-login.nix), used by nslcd to search for a user's DN by
# username before re-binding as them (their own bind can only ever see
# their own entry). Generate a real one with:
# openssl rand -hex 16
REPLACE-ME-WITH-A-REAL-SECRET-AT-LEAST-8-CHARS
